===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|nunne}}, from {{inh|de|goh|nunna}}, from {{der|de|ML.|nonna}}. The ''-o-'' is the regular outcome of {{m+|gmh||-u-}} before a nasal geminate, though it might have been reinforced by relatinisation.

